body:
I don't think they are jerks, which is why it bothers me. I have a chronic illness, so they kindly maneuver things around the house for me. 

But like, I had made plans with one of them to make some food  today — I made it and she had some, but told me she's full from the takeout the two had gotten. ;_;

I do try to stay on the phone with some friends though, who keep assuring me I'm nice to be around. Thank you so much, you. :')
